<mjml lang="ko">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>재훈님, 5분이면 첫 결과가 나와요</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>PRD 초안 만들기, 정말 5분이면 끝나요. 5분 미션 하나 남겨뒀어요.</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Pretendard" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.css" />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif" />
      <mj-text color="#1F1F2E" font-size="16px" line-height="1.75" />
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0" border-left="1px solid #EBE6F2" border-right="1px solid #EBE6F2" />
      <mj-button background-color="#845DDE" color="#ffffff" font-weight="700" font-size="16px" inner-padding="16px 32px" border-radius="10px" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      p, div, td, span, a, strong { word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
      a { color: #6A3FD1; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      .arrow-link a { text-decoration: underline; }
      .hl { background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 60%, #E9DEFF 60%); padding: 0 2px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F1F2E; }
      .accent { color: #6A3FD1; font-weight: 700; }
      @media only screen and (max-width:600px) {
        .h1-mob { font-size: 26px !important; line-height: 1.35 !important; }
        .h2-mob { font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 1.4 !important; }
        .pad-mob > table > tbody > tr > td { padding-left: 20px !important; padding-right: 20px !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#F5F3FA" width="600px">

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="28px 32px 20px" css-class="pad-mob">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="img/00_manyfast_logo.png" alt="Manyfast" align="left" width="160px" padding="0" href="https://manyfast.io/ko/" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Founder short letter -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="8px 32px 8px" css-class="pad-mob">
      <mj-column background-color="#F4F4F6" border-radius="16px" padding="28px">
        <mj-text font-size="14px" font-weight="700" color="#6A3FD1" padding="0 0 12px" letter-spacing="0.3px">
          잠깐 인사드릴게요
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text css-class="h2-mob" font-size="22px" line-height="1.4" font-weight="800" color="#1F1F2E" padding="0 0 16px" letter-spacing="-0.3px">
          재훈님, <span class="hl">아직 첫 프로젝트를 시작 못 하셨죠?</span>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.8" color="#2E2E3E" padding="0 0 16px">
          매니패스트를 만든 허재혁입니다. 매니패스트에 가입해주셨는데 아직 첫 프로젝트를 만들어보시지 않았더라고요. 혹시 어디서부터 시작해야 할지 막막하셨나 싶어서 이 편지를 씁니다.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.8" color="#2E2E3E" padding="0 0 0">
          <span class="hl">정말 5분이면 첫 결과가 나와요.</span> 완성이 아니라 논의의 시작점을 만들어드리는 게 저희 역할이거든요. 부담 없이 아이디어 한 문장만 던져보시면 됩니다.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Feature preview -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 32px 8px" css-class="pad-mob">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text css-class="h1-mob" font-size="24px" font-weight="800" color="#1F1F2E" padding="0 0 12px" letter-spacing="-0.3px" line-height="1.35">
          <span class="hl">아이디어 한 문장</span>이면 PRD 초안이 나와요.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="12px 0 20px" color="#4A4A5E" font-size="15px" line-height="1.7">
          매니패스트가 몇 가지 질문으로 구조를 잡아드리고, 대화가 끝나면 요구사항, 기능, 사용자 흐름이 정리된 PRD 초안을 만들어드립니다.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 32px 16px" css-class="pad-mob">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="img/01_ai_chat.png" alt="채팅으로 PRD 초안 만들기" border-radius="12px" padding="0" fluid-on-mobile="true" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Example prompts -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="16px 32px 8px" css-class="pad-mob">
      <mj-column background-color="#FAF7FF" border-radius="14px" padding="20px 22px">
        <mj-text font-size="13px" font-weight="700" color="#6A3FD1" padding="0 0 10px" letter-spacing="0.3px">
          이런 문장이면 충분해요
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" line-height="1.9" color="#4A4A5E" padding="0" font-style="italic">
          "1인 창업자를 위한 간단한 CRM 도구"<br />
          "팀원끼리 회의록을 공유하고 액션아이템을 관리하는 서비스"<br />
          "프리랜서 디자이너의 포트폴리오 자동 정리"
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 32px 32px" css-class="pad-mob">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-button href="https://manyfast.io/ko/" align="center">
          지금 5분 미션 시작하기
        </mj-button>
        <mj-text padding="16px 0 0" color="#6B7280" font-size="13px" line-height="1.7" align="center">
          시작이 어려우시면 <a href="https://forum.manyfast.io">커뮤니티 포럼</a>에 편하게 질문 남겨주세요.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Signature -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="8px 32px 40px" css-class="pad-mob">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-divider border-color="#E9DEFF" border-width="1px" padding="0 0 20px" />
        <mj-text font-size="15px" color="#1F1F2E" padding="0 0 4px">
          첫 프로젝트, 함께 시작해봐요.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="17px" font-weight="800" color="#1F1F2E" padding="0 0 4px">
          허재혁
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" color="#6B7280" padding="0">
          매니패스트 창업자
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#F5F3FA" padding="28px 32px 36px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#6B7280" font-size="13px" line-height="1.7" padding="0 0 12px">
          <a href="https://manyfast.io/ko/" style="color:#4A4A5E;">대시보드</a> &nbsp; <a href="https://manyfast.io/features/ai" style="color:#4A4A5E;">사용 가이드</a> &nbsp; <a href="https://blog.manyfast.io" style="color:#4A4A5E;">블로그</a> &nbsp; <a href="https://forum.manyfast.io" style="color:#4A4A5E;">포럼</a>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#9CA3AF" font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" padding="8px 0 4px">
          Manyfast Inc.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#9CA3AF" font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" padding="4px 0">
          <a href="{unsubscribe_link}" style="color:#9CA3AF; text-decoration: underline;">수신 거부</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
